records.severityRationale:
Training records produced today would be rejected by an auditor:
- acks of old versions count toward new versions;
- anyone can 'acknowledge' a draft or retired SOP;
- the method is self-declared;
- the denominator is everyone in the organization.
The paths that let anyone write anyone's training, or let the model write it, are closed, so this is not P0.
